# The exposure-docs guard's OPTIONAL exact-token list (src/docs/exposure-docs.test.ts). It holds the
# real machine names, tailnet ids and secret fragments of whichever box this checkout is on, so the
# guard can catch them EXACTLY — a bare hostname in a runbook has no shape for a pattern to match.
# It must NEVER be committed: a committed token list, or a digest of one (8 hex brute-forces in
# milliseconds), publishes exactly what it exists to keep private. Absent is the normal case — CI and
# every clone run the shape rules alone.
.exposure-tokens.local

